{"4328150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shmoblins", "steam_appid": 4328150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees down to keep the campfire fed and stay close at night—for only light can keep the dreadful Shmorra away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328150/extras/d3608d7eae64cd29857a202cfee1b4fe.poster.avif?t=1769203800\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328150/extras/d3608d7eae64cd29857a202cfee1b4fe.webm?t=1769203800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328150/extras/d3608d7eae64cd29857a202cfee1b4fe.mp4?t=1769203800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your safe zone, explore further into the woods, and bring back anything you find. Fight lesser beasts, eat suspicious mushrooms, stock up with someone else's supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invent!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the crafting bench to arm yourself with useful tools and gadgets for cooking, hunting, and defending. Turn your camp into a somewhat defendable camp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be raided!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will besiege your camp sooner than you think. Prepare yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're ready, launch raids of your own. Take on the brutish Farmer, the mysterious Dark Knight, or even the Necromancer himself! Defeating bosses is the only way to get precious gold. And who doesn't like gold, right?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees down to keep the campfire fed and stay close at night—for only light can keep the dreadful Shmorra away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328150/extras/d3608d7eae64cd29857a202cfee1b4fe.poster.avif?t=1769203800\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328150/extras/d3608d7eae64cd29857a202cfee1b4fe.webm?t=1769203800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4328150/extras/d3608d7eae64cd29857a202cfee1b4fe.mp4?t=1769203800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your safe zone, explore further into the woods, and bring back anything you find. Fight lesser beasts, eat suspicious mushrooms, stock up with someone else's supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invent!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the crafting bench to arm yourself with useful tools and gadgets for cooking, hunting, and defending. Turn your camp into a somewhat defendable camp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be raided!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will besiege your camp sooner than you think. Prepare yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're ready, launch raids of your own. Take on the brutish Farmer, the mysterious Dark Knight, or even the Necromancer himself! Defeating bosses is the only way to get precious gold. A